{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118181631505-1118_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261118185101\"/><p>深圳國際交流中心是APEC峰會主會場之一。</p><p>亞太經合組織（APEC）第33次領導人非正式會議周三（18日）至周四（19日）在中國深圳舉行。中國國家主席習近平和夫人彭麗媛周三晚在深圳國際交流中心舉行宴會歡迎來賓。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:04:02.832418+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:16:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:20.383151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:23.767132+00:00","content_hash":"f404099340338a3a2c21d8b720a03009c2243708334d2c2c86692fd2ff62bb9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}